\title{seuratflow: Seurat Preprocessing Workflow with Built-in Quality Control Reports}
\description{
Helpers that automate a Seurat (v5) single-cell RNA-seq preprocessing workflow: parallel reading of 10X matrix, 10X h5 and CellBender output with per-cell quality control (MAD-based outlier flags and optional doublet detection), log-normalization or SCTransform with Harmony integration, resolution selection (clustree and silhouette scores), marker detection with DotPlots at every resolution, and ggplot2 themes for UMAPs. Quality control tables, plots and parameters are written to a 'QualityControl' folder with automatically sized figures.
